OL,3,GNEWSA'No punishment would have stopped
OL,4,Ame shoplifting'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former offender has said no
OL,7,Fpunishment would have stopped her
OL,8,Fshoplifting while she was addicted to
OL,9,Fdrugs.
OL,11,FJade Smith, 35, from Skelton in
OL,12,FCleveland, said she spent all of her
OL,13,Fmoney on cocaine and then stole food
OL,14,Fand household essentials because she
OL,15,Fhad "nothing to live on" until she got
OL,16,Fpaid again.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
