OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1789624063
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'No punishment would have stopped
OL,4,Ame shoplifting'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter convictions, homelessness and a
OL,7,Fperiod living in a tent, she is now
OL,8,Ffive to six weeks clean at a
OL,9,Frehabilitation facility in Preston and
OL,10,Ftrying to rebuild relationships with
OL,11,Fher children and family.
OL,13,FSmith said: "I do now think about the
OL,14,Fshop workers and how they felt. I'd
OL,15,Flike to apologise. I wish I'd thought
OL,16,Fat the time how other people would be
OL,17,Ffeeling and not just myself. It was
OL,18,Fquite selfish really."
